    "title": "It's time for the Oscars! How to watch the 2026 Academy Awards",
    "text": "Updated March 15, 2026, 5:00 p.m. ETThe awards begin live at 7 p.m. on ABC and Hulu TVAmong the nominees are Kate Hudson for her performance in \"Song Sung Blue,\" which was filmed on location in Montclair.The biggest night in Hollywood kicks off at 7 p.m. on Sunday, March 15, as the 98th Academy Awards airs coast-to-coast. Filmmakers and actors will take home statuettes for their work on some of the most lauded movies of 2025.Viewers can watch the ceremony, hosted by Conan O'Brien, with all its glitz and glamor, broadcast live on their local ABC affiliate, or streaming online through Hulu TV, FuboTV or YouTubeTV, and via AT&T TV.Among the contenders are Kate Hudson, for her performance in the musical drama \"Song Sung Blue,\" which was filmed on location in Montclair, Wayne and Paterson.Here are the nominees for some of this year's top awards:Best picture\"Bugonia\"\"F1\"\"Frankenstein\"\"Hamnet\"\"Marty Supreme\"\"One Battle After Another\"\"The Secret Agent\"\"Sentimental Value\"\"Sinners\"\"Train Dreams\"Best actor in a leading roleTimothée Chalamet, \"Marty Supreme\"Leonardo DiCaprio, \"One Battle After Another\"Ethan Hawke, \"Blue Moon\"Michael B. Jordan, \"Sinners\"Wagner Moura, \"The Secret Agent\"Best actress in a leading roleJessie Buckley, \"Hamnet\"Rose Byrne, \"If I Had Legs I'd Kick You\"Kate Hudson, \"Song Sung Blue\"Renate Reinsve, \"Sentimental Value\"Emma Stone, \"Bugonia\"Best directorChloé Zhao, \"Hamnet\"Josh Safdie, \"Marty Supreme\"Paul Thomas Anderson, \"One Battle After Another\"Joachim Trier, \"Sentimental Value\"Ryan Coogler, \"Sinners\"Best actor in a supporting roleBenicio del Toro, \"One Battle After Another\"Jacob Elordi, \"Frankenstein\"Delroy Lindo, \"Sinners\"Sean Penn, \"One Battle After Another\"Stellan Skarsgård, \"Sentimental Value\"Best actress in a supporting roleElle Fanning, \"Sentimental Value\"Inga Ibsdotter Lilleaas, \"Sentimental Value\"Amy Madigan, \"Weapons\"Wunmi Mosaku, \"Sinners\"Teyana Taylor, \"One Battle After Another\"",
